    {
      "title": "Fiji Declares a National Emergency as H.I.V. Cases Skyrocket",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/16/world/asia/fiji-hiv-national-emergency.html",
      "description": "Surging drug use has contributed to an epidemic in the Pacific island nation, where one in 60 adults is estimated to be living with the virus.",
